# Scratch directory for one-off prompt-tuning evals (segmented text
# corpora, baseline annotation outputs). Inputs land here so the
# transcribe-worker and web containers can read them via the existing
# seed-data bind mount; nothing in here is part of the committed seed
# snapshots.
